config LIB_BUILTINS
	bool "Always build the compiler runtime helpers"
	help
	  64-bit division helpers (__udivdi3 and friends) the compiler may
	  call on RV32. They are built automatically when the toolchain ships
	  no libgcc/compiler-rt for the target; enable this to build them
	  regardless.
